exports[`bundled per-turn template — system and user halves > matches the recorded snapshot with every block filled 1`] = `
{
  "system": "# Setting
A keep on a hill.

# Genre
High fantasy.

# Tone
Dry humor.

# Calendar
This story tracks time in seconds (1 seconds per second). Tiers: month (January and February). Convert relative-time prose ("two days later", "the next morning") into a seconds delta on <world_time_delta> using these units.

Write the next beat of the story as prose. Do not break character or address the reader.",
  "user": "# In scene

## Aria [char_1]
A wary scout.

# Current location

[loc_1] The Keep: A weathered hilltop fortress.

# Places
[loc_1] The Keep
Unplaced:
  [loc_7] Varn

